;; world/rooms/wrongwater/x0y7.room
(room
  region: wrongwater
  at: (0 7)
  title: "The Seventh"
  intent: "above the highest water, on a dry shelf, a violet note waits that no stone has ever answered"
  bed: (air 0.15 water 0.3 hang 0.6 drone 0.6)
  light: 0.6
  grid:
  ("#########################"
   "########         ########"
   "         ===     ########"
   "                    #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####"
   "#############       #####")
  things: ((harmonic at: (10 1) overtone: 7))
  decor: auto)
;; The shelf from the tarn (standing row 3) runs east under a raised roof
;; to a lip over a shaft seven wide (13-19) that drops through the whole
;; room into the Way Out: one way, too wide to kick up and with no rough
;; rock. H7 waits above the shelf on a one-way ledge (9-11, row 2), a jump
;; up through it; the walk east passes under it, so H7 can be left (the
;; map: bypassed from C, home through F). Back west, the shelf leads to
;; the tarn's top: drop in and sink out of its bottom. No moment: H7 enters
;; the drone in ambience.
